Z||000001||mrfiero||02-01-2001||01:08 AM||||As far as I know you can't just change the bulb......it's soldered to the socket.<P>Is yours burnt out?     ||||reg||1
Z||000002||Feenx||02-01-2001||01:37 AM||||The Haynes Manual says<BR>that the third brake light bulb is a Quartz Halogen <BR>and to replace it just pop off the housing,disconnect the electrical connector and pull out the bulb.<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>86 Sport Coupe (Red)<BR>2.5L Auto||||reg||1
